# StackLoop code ownership
#
# Ownership follows the team model in docs/monorepo-architecture.md section 17.
# Replace the placeholder handles with real teams once the GitHub organization exists.

# Default owner for anything not matched below
*                       @your-org/maintainers

# Applications
/apps/web/              @your-org/web-team
/apps/api/              @your-org/api-team

# AI service
/services/ai/           @your-org/ai-team

# Shared packages
/packages/ui/           @your-org/web-team
/packages/design-system/ @your-org/web-team
/packages/domain/       @your-org/api-team
/packages/data-access/  @your-org/api-team
/packages/auth/         @your-org/api-team

# Database schema and migrations require API team review
/apps/api/prisma/       @your-org/api-team
/db/                    @your-org/api-team

# Infrastructure, tooling, and automation
/infra/                 @your-org/platform-team
/configs/               @your-org/platform-team
/scripts/               @your-org/platform-team
/.github/               @your-org/platform-team

# Security-sensitive documents require maintainer review
/SECURITY.md            @your-org/maintainers
/docs/auth-security-spec.md @your-org/maintainers

# Product and delivery state
/docs/prd.md            @your-org/maintainers
/docs/phase-tracker.md  @your-org/maintainers
/docs/adr/              @your-org/maintainers
